---
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---
<section id="prezzo" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10">
<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center">Un solo prezzo, chiaro</h2>
<div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-md rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-brand-panel p-6 text-center">
<p class="text-sm text-brand-muted">Setup una tantum</p>
<p class="mt-2 text-5xl font-extrabold">149€</p>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-muted">Prova {siteConfig.price.trialDays} giorni · Nessun canone mensile (Art.67 TUIR)</p>
<ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-left text-sm">
<li>✓ Installazione done-for-you</li>
<li>✓ Promemoria WhatsApp automatici</li>
<li>✓ 30 giorni di assistenza inclusa</li>
<li>✓ Nessun costo nascosto, nessun lock-in</li>
</ul>
<p class="mt-4 text-left text-sm text-brand-muted">✕ Niente abbonamento ✕ Niente commissioni a prenotazione</p>
<a href="#contatto" class="mt-6 block rounded-lg bg-brand-accent px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white">Richiedi la prova gratuita</a>
</div>
</section>
